{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by 90s Survival Horror and JRPGs</strong><br>This game is a prequel to <strong>DEEP 8</strong>, which you can play for free on Steam.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixed Cameras</strong><br>Experience fixed camera angles that create tension by limiting your field of view while presenting scenes like paintings. Exploration becomes a rewarding adventure as you uncover hidden corners and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-Based Battles</strong><br>Relive the classic 90s JRPG vibe with modern touches. Engage in tactical, turn-based combat that challenges your strategy and efficiency as you face tough enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World Map</strong><br>Rediscover the charm of a connected, expansive world through a classic world map, making exploration feel vast and meaningful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics</strong><br>The visuals are inspired by the PS2 era, focusing on charm over photorealism. Main characters feature detailed models, while animations are lovingly crafted by hand rather than motion-captured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>Like its sequel, <strong>DEEP 8</strong>, <i>Fille Fatale Compassion</i> delves into dark and disturbing themes, but it doesn\u2019t shy away from humor. Expect moments of comic relief to balance the intensity of its narrative.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3388280?t=1765731224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765731224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388280/3622d8e6c1cf2f8c78ace6fe9badff1f7b45d5f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765731224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388280/3622d8e6c1cf2f8c78ac